{"id":"n3-041","title":"～ついでに","romaji":"〜tsuide ni","jlptLevel":3,"shortExplanation":"Do something while or after completing another action; 'while', 'by the way'.","longExplanation":"The ～ついでに grammar point is used to express doing something 'on the occasion of' another action. It can mean 'while you're at it', 'by the way', or 'in passing'.","formation":"Verb (dictionary or た-form) + ついでに, Noun + の + ついでに, or Verb-て form + いる + ついでに","examples":[{"jp":"買い物に行くついでに、郵便局で手紙を出しましょう。","romaji":"Kaimono ni iku tsuide ni, yuubinkyoku de tegami wo dashimashou.","en":"Let's drop off a letter at the post office while going shopping.","words":[{"surface":"買い物","vocabId":"1589730","reading":"かいもの"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行く","vocabId":"1578850","reading":"いく"},{"surface":"ついで","vocabId":"1316390","reading":"ついで"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"郵便","vocabId":"1605680","reading":"ゆうびん"},{"surface":"局","vocabId":"1239560","reading":"きょく"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"手紙","vocabId":"1327720","reading":"てがみ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"出し","vocabId":"1339160","reading":"だし","baseForm":"出す"},{"surface":"ましょ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"う","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4]},{"jp":"図書館で本を借りたついでに、友達に会いました。","romaji":"Toshokan de hon wo karita tsuide ni, tomodachi ni aimashita.","en":"I met my friend while borrowing a book from the library.","words":[{"surface":"図書館","vocabId":"1370420","reading":"としょかん"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"本","vocabId":"1522150","reading":"ほん"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"借り","vocabId":"1323540","reading":"かり","baseForm":"借りる"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ついで","vocabId":"1316390","reading":"ついで"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"友達","vocabId":"1540170","reading":"ともだち"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"会い","vocabId":"